00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:14.000
I love to see how people celebrate things differently, like around the world.

206
00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:14.460
Me too.

207
00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:17.180
Well, in the UK, it's called Kris Kringle.

208
00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:24.520
In Ireland, it's called Kris Kindle, which is an adaptation of Kris Kindle, which means

209
00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:25.160
Christ child.

