00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.300
It's not Secret Santa there.

211
00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.720
It'd be Secret Kris Kringle.

212
00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.220
Yeah, but I don't even think you say the secret part.

213
00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.680
I think you just say, let's do a Kris Kindle gift exchange.

214
00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:35.520
Oh, okay.

215
00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:40.880
In Germany, it's called Wichtlin, which means goblin or elf.

216
00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:41.340
Hmm.

