00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:48.100
Now, some people believe that the whole thing originated in Scandinavia, where it's called

218
00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:53.220
juklop, and involves basically leaving a gift at someone's door, knocking, and then

219
00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:53.800
running away.

220
00:09:54.980 --> 00:10:01.000
But in all of these traditions, there's one thing that remains constant, which is that

221
00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:06.740
you have to give somebody a gift in secret, either out of the goodness of your heart or

222
00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:11.140
through an organized gift exchange, where you, like, draw names, as in our episode.

