00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:36.440
So the tradition of giving out secret gifts has been going on forever, but this name,

229
00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:40.500
Secret Santa, was sort of originally given to this man.

230
00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:41.900
Oh, I want to hear all about it.

231
00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:47.080
He gave out anonymous gifts during the holidays for more than 25 years.

232
00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:51.980
He would walk around wearing sometimes a red sweater.

233
00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:56.900
I saw one photo of him in, like, white overalls with a red sweater and a little red hat.

234
00:10:57.400 --> 00:11:01.760
And he would give people $100 bills, just randomly.

235
00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:09.280
After 9-11, he donated over $25,000 in the form of $100 bills to New Yorkers.

236
00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:14.980
He was so famous for handing out this money that he was profiled in USA Today one year, but

237
00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.040
they kept it anonymous.

238
00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:17.360
They didn't say who he was.

239
00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:17.680
Aw.

240
00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:23.340
But his identity was finally revealed in 2006 after he was diagnosed with cancer.

241
00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:25.660
It was a pretty aggressive form of cancer.

242
00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:31.580
And what I read in an article was that someone knew who he was, and they were going to reveal

243
00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:31.960
