244
00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.480
So he decided to come out and say who he was.

245
00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:41.500
But according to this article in USA Today, he was quoted as saying he has no strict criteria

246
00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:43.440
