00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:42.640
And it was a Christmas card that me and Brian and Oscar made and gave to everyone.

455
00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:44.220
Oh, my gosh.

456
00:22:45.580 --> 00:22:48.540
I remember you guys used to do an accountant's card at Christmas.

457
00:22:48.660 --> 00:22:48.920
Yes.

458
00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:52.220
I would make them take a picture with me in character, and we would give it to everyone.

459
00:22:52.840 --> 00:22:57.900
Well, Andy has a talking head where he begged Dwight and Jim to give him Aaron for Secret Santa.

460
00:22:58.800 --> 00:23:02.680
And he's the one who's giving out the 12 days of Christmas gifts.

461
00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:07.780
And he says, is it his fault that the first eight days amount to 30 birds?

462
00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:12.940
And during this talking head, you can see him trying to put little bow ties on some swans.

463
00:23:13.100 --> 00:23:16.180
You see Aaron go to her car, and it's filled with geese.

