815
00:38:43.100 --> 00:38:47.600
The writers would have Michael come out of his office, make an announcement, and that would

816
00:38:47.600 --> 00:38:48.960
often lead to the act break.

817
00:38:49.360 --> 00:38:51.140
And that's exactly what happens here.

818
00:38:51.260 --> 00:38:51.720
It's true.

819
00:38:52.260 --> 00:38:54.780
So you got a little act break alley there.

820
00:38:56.040 --> 00:39:00.480
Dwight is convinced that his secret Santa is sending him pieces of a gun.

821
00:39:00.860 --> 00:39:03.320
But this last piece doesn't make any sense.

822
00:39:03.520 --> 00:39:05.040
Why did they send him a dial?

823
00:39:05.220 --> 00:39:06.420
They should have sent him a trigger.

824
00:39:07.100 --> 00:39:09.940
And Meredith and Phyllis are like, why do you think it's a gun?

825
00:39:10.600 --> 00:39:16.120
And then Stanley has a great line where he says, unless the missing piece is a gun, you

826
00:39:16.120 --> 00:39:17.100
don't have a gun.

827
00:39:18.040 --> 00:39:20.180
I don't know why that tickles me so much.

828
00:39:20.560 --> 00:39:21.880
His delivery was so good.

829
00:39:22.300 --> 00:39:24.680
We got a fan question from Beth G.

830
00:39:24.880 --> 00:39:25.920
