00:39:26.180 --> 00:39:33.540
Who came up with the list of Dwight's speculations on what his Christmas present might be as he builds

832
00:39:33.540 --> 00:39:33.800
it?

833
00:39:34.140 --> 00:39:36.580
You know, he has that piece of paper with the liSt.

