874
00:41:53.140 --> 00:41:55.880
Suddenly, I am incapable of doing that action.

875
00:41:55.880 --> 00:42:01.220
I multitask in my kitchen constantly, and I'm always thinking about it, too.

876
00:42:01.400 --> 00:42:06.720
Like, as I'm, like, shutting the fridge with my foot while scrambling an egg and drinking coffee

877
00:42:06.720 --> 00:42:11.740
and, like, organizing some homework papers in the morning and holding a conversation,

878
00:42:11.740 --> 00:42:15.780
I think to myself, if this was written out for me, I could never do it.

879
00:42:15.900 --> 00:42:16.820
I don't know what it is.

880
00:42:16.860 --> 00:42:19.900
It's so hard just to memorize your lines and say them truthfully.

881
00:42:20.660 --> 00:42:24.240
This amount of business is—people should study it.

882
00:42:24.300 --> 00:42:25.200
He does such a good job.

883
00:42:25.880 --> 00:42:27.020
And with comic timing.

884
00:42:27.260 --> 00:42:27.780
I know.

885
00:42:27.880 --> 00:42:31.980
I always think of this when I would watch shows like ER or Grey's Anatomy,

886
00:42:32.140 --> 00:42:34.660
