887
00:42:34.660 --> 00:42:37.840
and they're yelling out all of this medical jargon, like,

888
00:42:38.060 --> 00:42:41.360
stick to me this, blah, blah, blah, blah, blah, and they're, like, having to do all this action.

889
00:42:41.360 --> 00:42:43.880
I'm like, well, that'll be a job I never have because—

890
00:42:43.880 --> 00:42:44.100
Yes.

891
00:42:44.240 --> 00:42:46.560
That's a lot of talking and moving at the same time.

892
00:42:47.040 --> 00:42:47.360
Yeah.

893
00:42:47.580 --> 00:42:48.660
I won't be able to do it.

894
00:42:48.740 --> 00:42:50.860
Lots of business is hard to do.

895
00:42:51.020 --> 00:42:51.580
Lots of business.

896
00:42:51.620 --> 00:42:53.680
Because then also you have to, like, match it.

897
00:42:53.840 --> 00:42:54.840
Yeah, every time.

898
00:42:56.800 --> 00:42:58.380
We were both very impressed.

899
00:42:58.640 --> 00:42:59.340
We were.

900
00:42:59.480 --> 00:43:04.060
We were also cast on the perfect show because we often didn't have to do a lot of business.

901
00:43:04.280 --> 00:43:05.300
We were just at our desks.

902
00:43:05.580 --> 00:43:05.760
True.

