995
00:47:14.340 --> 00:47:16.100
Did you notice the other warehouse workers?

996
00:47:16.380 --> 00:47:20.020
Yes, I noticed Madge and all the guys are at this party.

997
00:47:20.680 --> 00:47:23.540
Well, there was a whole runner that was cut from the episode.

998
00:47:23.620 --> 00:47:28.340
It is in the extended producer's cut, where Michael goes down to the warehouse and invites

999
00:47:28.340 --> 00:47:29.480
