1001
00:47:32.240 --> 00:47:32.520
Why?

1002
00:47:33.140 --> 00:47:36.540
Jim is annoyed because he did not plan to feed that many people.

1003
00:47:36.880 --> 00:47:37.320
Oh.

1004
00:47:37.460 --> 00:47:41.100
I thought it was really cute, because he was all of a sudden concerned about food.

1005
00:47:41.660 --> 00:47:46.260
The rest of the office is grumpy, because the warehouse workers start eating everything,

