1010
00:48:03.820 --> 00:48:04.240
Oh.

1011
00:48:04.440 --> 00:48:05.620
Because she loves lasagna?

1012
00:48:05.840 --> 00:48:07.260
Because she loves lasagna.

1013
00:48:07.420 --> 00:48:09.700
And when she sees it, she has to eat it all.

1014
00:48:09.700 --> 00:48:15.220
This results in a scene where she eats the entire lasagna that Pam brought, while the

1015
00:48:15.220 --> 00:48:18.820
