1016
00:48:19.680 --> 00:48:20.240
Amazing.

1017
00:48:20.600 --> 00:48:25.420
Yes, there were so many extra scenes of the warehouse people driving everyone in the bullpen

1018
00:48:25.420 --> 00:48:25.860
crazy.

1019
00:48:26.280 --> 00:48:30.520
The second thing I want to share is on the commentary, Mindy and Ellie talked about how

1020
00:48:30.520 --> 00:48:36.380
when they met Sam Daly, who played Matt, they got so tickled because they thought Sam and

1021
00:48:36.380 --> 00:48:38.760
Ellie looked a lot alike in real life.

1022
00:48:38.760 --> 00:48:40.620
Like they could be brother and sister?

1023
00:48:40.880 --> 00:48:41.320
Yes.

1024
00:48:41.540 --> 00:48:44.320
So I did a side-by-side and I want to show you.

1025
00:48:45.120 --> 00:48:46.540
All right, Jenna, look at this.

1026
00:48:46.620 --> 00:48:47.560
I'll put it in stories.

1027
00:48:47.880 --> 00:48:48.800
I see it.

1028
00:48:49.980 --> 00:48:51.320
Oh my gosh.

1029
00:48:52.760 --> 00:48:54.440
They definitely could be family.

1030
00:48:54.720 --> 00:48:55.360
I know.

1031
00:48:56.460 --> 00:49:00.520
So I guess this is something Ellie was tickled about, Ellie and Mindy, during the week of

1032
00:49:00.520 --> 00:49:00.920
filming.

1033
00:49:02.320 --> 00:49:04.780
Michael is very cranky.

1034
00:49:05.540 --> 00:49:12.340
He has like sat down kind of in the very middle of the party with a microphone and

1035
00:49:12.340 --> 00:49:16.880
