1036
00:49:17.140 --> 00:49:19.360
Yeah, he's doing like snarky commentary.

1037
00:49:19.780 --> 00:49:20.020
Yeah.

1038
00:49:21.040 --> 00:49:24.140
Angela gets some fabric.

1039
00:49:24.460 --> 00:49:25.380
Some gray fabric.

1040
00:49:25.640 --> 00:49:26.940
She is so touched.

1041
00:49:27.080 --> 00:49:27.400
I know.

1042
00:49:27.400 --> 00:49:29.200
This person really knew her well.

1043
00:49:29.760 --> 00:49:33.060
Michael says now she can make another dress that goes past her feet.

1044
00:49:34.420 --> 00:49:43.080
It is also during this snarky commentary that Michael reveals that Andy is Aaron's secret

1045
00:49:43.080 --> 00:49:43.620
Santa.

1046
00:49:44.320 --> 00:49:45.000
Oof.

1047
00:49:45.560 --> 00:49:46.140
Oh man.

1048
00:49:46.700 --> 00:49:48.340
Aaron does not look happy.

1049
