And I love David Wallace's response because he says, either you tell me or I'm hanging up.

1056
00:50:10.280 --> 00:50:12.960
Like I'm not, I'm not guessing what you're dressed as.

1057
00:50:12.960 --> 00:50:13.360
I'm not doing this now.

1058
00:50:13.640 --> 00:50:18.400
Well, David said this is a really bad time and asked for Stephanie, his assistant, to step

1059
00:50:18.400 --> 00:50:18.780
